{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender PropertyRNA.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender PropertyRNA.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender property rna blender property rna","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender PropertyRNA.md","fileName":"Blender PropertyRNA.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender PropertyRNA","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-14 00:20\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Blender RNA Data Architecture]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender RNA Data Architecture","Blender RNA Typed Property","Blender ContainerRNA","Blender PointerRNA","coreblenderdevelopment.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender PropertyRNA.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender PropertyRNA.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender property rna blender property rna","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender PropertyRNA.md","fileName":"Blender PropertyRNA.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender PropertyRNA","heading":"Blender PropertyRNA","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"`PropertyRNA` is the common base record for properties exposed through Blender RNA. It provides linked-list membership, a unique identifier, optional nested structure information, Python callback data, flags, descriptions, update behavior, and the shared metadata needed by typed property variants.\n\nSpecific [[Blender RNA Typed Property]] records place this base at the start of a larger C structure and add type-appropriate accessors and limits. The properties are collected by [[Blender ContainerRNA]] and reached through [[Blender PointerRNA]] by the runtime Data API.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender RNA Data Architecture","Blender RNA Typed Property","Blender ContainerRNA","Blender PointerRNA","coreblenderdevelopment.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd